<view class="safe"><view class="nav"><view class="brand"><text class="mark">▲</text>飞巡</view><button class="publish" bindtap="publish">发布需求</button></view><view class="hero"><image src="/assets/drone-hero.png" mode="aspectFill"/><view class="cover"></view><view class="hero-copy"><view class="headline">让每一次起飞，<br/>都有价值</view><view class="sub">连接靠谱飞手与真实项目<br/>支付信息费后即可直接联系</view><button class="primary hero-btn" scroll-into-view="jobs">浏览附近任务</button><view class="trust">实名认证 · 资质审核 · 信息保障</view></view></view><view class="content" id="jobs"><view class="section-title">正在招募的飞行任务</view><view class="muted intro">真实需求每日更新，选择你擅长的项目</view><scroll-view class="filters" scroll-x enhanced show-scrollbar="false"><view class="filter-row"><button wx:for="{{filters}}" wx:key="*this" class="filter {{active===item?'on':''}}" data-name="{{item}}" bindtap="filter">{{item}}</button></view></scroll-view><view class="list"><view class="job" wx:for="{{shown}}" wx:key="id" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="open"><view class="top"><text class="city">⌖ {{item.city}}</text><text class="price">¥{{item.price}}</text></view><view class="title">{{item.title}}</view><view class="bottom"><text>{{item.type}} · {{item.date}}</text><text class="go">查看详情 ›</text></view></view><view class="empty" wx:if="{{!shown.length}}">暂无相关任务</view></view></view><view class="employer"><view class="section-title dark">正在找专业飞手？</view><view>发布需求免费，选定飞手后再支付信息服务费。</view><button bindtap="publish">免费发布需求 →</button></view></view>
